    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      According to Theorem <a href="/tag/A37F6A" data-tag="A37F6A">4.1.3.1</a>, it suffices to prove that for every object $D \in \calD $, simplicial set $\calC \times _{\calD } \calD _{D/}$ is weakly contractible. Lemma <a href="/tag/D7B730" data-tag="D7B730">5.1.4.4</a> asserts that $f_{D/}$ is also an idempotent completion, and Lemma <a href="/tag/107339" data-tag="107339">5.1.4.5</a> completes the proof. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
